{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Like a Dog&quot; is a  game in the anomaly-search genre, telling the story of a psychologically unstable laboratory worker who conducted terrible experiments on dogs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully examine the laboratory environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see an anomaly \u2014 go back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there is no anomaly\u00a0\u2014 go next</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signs will help you navigate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not miss any anomalies and reach the end</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concise and unusual story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to review previously missed anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings. To unlock the second, you need to replay the game with minor changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is not limited to the laboratory environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter eggs hidden within anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 diverse anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplified gameplay mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game duration:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from 1 to 3 hours</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734250?t=1767453890","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734250/a06f6190cdd161744406b92c09d98d384df746d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767453890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734250/50d0fabaf872dd6a2d2dbcabef28e1383ce76bf7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767453890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734250/50d0fabaf872dd6a2d2db